    "acceptance-unseen": {
      "_why": [
        "One v1 panel: operator = 'acc-unseen' AND application = 'shown-app' AND",
        "(node_name = 'n1' OR severity = 'critical') AND node_name != 'junk'. No v2 panel.",
        "Identity leaves (spec 6): operator = 'acc-unseen' matches every row, so it hides",
        "none; application = 'shown-app' hides every row whose application differs. The",
        "OR-nested node_name = 'n1' is an identity leaf that cannot be evaluated: it adds 1 to",
        "unseen_unmeasured and never hides. severity is a classification field and is",
        "ignored. node_name != 'junk' is the only suppression leaf (no negation sits under",
        "the OR, so suppression_unmeasured = 0).",
        "7 v1 rows: u01 other-app/n1 on 08-23 and 08-24; u02 shown-app/n1 on 08-23 and",
        "08-24; u03 shown-app/junk, u04 shown-app/n2, u05 other-app/junk on 08-23.",
        "No R6: at most two firing rows per alert, opened 54h before window_end.",
        "Suppressed: u03 and u05 (2 of 7 = 29%, under the 50% guard) => R5 [2, 2] on 08-23.",
        "Hidden by the panel: u01 (2 rows) and u05. Unseen = hidden minus suppressed = u01's",
        "2 rows: 1 on 08-23, 1 on 08-24. u05 counts only as suppressed. u04 is seen because",
        "the only leaf that would hide it is the unmeasured OR leaf.",
        "unseen_unmeasured = 1, on v1's first bucket (08-18) only; every other v1 bucket has",
        "unseen 0, not NULL, because the schema has a panel.",
        "v2: 2 ready identities on 08-23, no panel => unseen and unseen_unmeasured NULL on",
        "every v2 bucket and NULL on both v2 work-list rows.",
        "Model: u01, u02, u04 (v1) and uv01, uv02 (v2) are assessed_good; u03, u05 are",
        "rule_flagged. v1 assessed_good by date: 08-23 3, 08-24 2 (u01, u02) => 5.",
        "Both schemas present, readiness 2/2 => phase_1, 100%."
